## Deploying / Moving To Another Machine

Moving `bias_system_v3/` alone is not enough. You also need:

| What | Where |
|---|---|
| `bias_system_v3/` | Model weights + tokenizer — copy this folder |
| `bert-base-uncased` HuggingFace cache | `~/.cache/huggingface/hub/models--bert-base-uncased/` |
| `train_bias_v3.py` | Inference code |
| Python dependencies | `pip install -r requirements-backend.txt` |

Copy the HuggingFace cache to avoid re-downloading (~440 MB):

```bash
# on source machine
cp -r ~/.cache/huggingface/hub/models--bert-base-uncased/ /transfer/

# on target machine
mkdir -p ~/.cache/huggingface/hub/
cp -r /transfer/models--bert-base-uncased/ ~/.cache/huggingface/hub/
```
